# Opalescence on an enchantment of mana value 0. Valgavoth's Lair is an Enchantment Land with no mana cost, so its mana
# value is 0 (CR 202.3a): once Bot1 casts Opalescence it is an Enchantment Land Creature with base power and toughness
# 0/0, and the state-based actions put a creature with toughness 0 into its owner's graveyard (CR 704.5f). It was on
# the battlefield, an enchantment land, until then.

